# Platform: mobilesite
# Requirement: GJDT-22788 — restricted category handling on B2B search ("Current Handlings on Live" table, Prashant 05-Oct-2026)
# Case SR04 Mumbai: Gujarat-only rule — the same glue-type terms still show results outside Gujarat (Mumbai)
# Non-Gujarat control for the city-wise RASV rule
# Tags: b2b, search, restricted, GJDT-22788, sanity
# rat glue pad in Mumbai -> results
store "Mumbai" as city
store "rat glue pad" as search_term
call SG_22788_Freetext_Search_In_City
# outside Gujarat the term is not blocked: a result / product page opens (it can be a shop-online product page)
verify element b2b_search_no_results is not visible
verify page does not contain "No results found"
take screenshot as mumbai_ratgluepad
# mouse glue trap in Mumbai -> results
store "mouse glue trap" as search_term
call SG_22788_Search_Again_On_Result_Page
# outside Gujarat the term is not blocked: a result / product page opens (it can be a shop-online product page)
verify element b2b_search_no_results is not visible
verify page does not contain "No results found"
take screenshot as mumbai_mousegluetrap
